### Variables
@apiVersion = /api/admin

###
### ============================================
### TEMPLATE ENDPOINTS - LIST TEMPLATES
### ============================================
###

### List Templates - Success (Super Admin - includes web_view_link)
# @name listTemplates
GET {{bevalk_base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/templates
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Templates - Success (Admin - no web_view_link)
# @name listTemplatesAdmin
GET {{bevalk_base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/templates
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List Templates - Success (Secretary - no web_view_link)
# @name listTemplatesSecretary
GET {{bevalk_base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/templates
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{secretaryToken}}

### List Templates - Without Authentication
# Should return 401 Unauthorized
GET {{bevalk_base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/templates
Accept: application/json

###
### ============================================
### TEMPLATE FILTERS
### ============================================
###

### Filter Templates by Name
# @name filterTemplatesByName
GET {{bevalk_base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/templates?name=Plantilla
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter Templates by Name (Partial Match)
# @name filterTemplatesByNamePartial
GET {{bevalk_base_url}}{{apiVersion}}/templates?name=Acta
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

